    "text": "<p>Total distance covered by the body is equal to the modulus of area under graph&nbsp;velocity-time graph</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>37</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>",
